; ========================================
; ＞『湖方面』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我在森林简单探索了一番，直到来到湖畔。|#0202Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:"（把她沉到湖底也是可行的吧。<br>　……能毁尸灭迹就最好不过了）|#0202Adv09_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我眺望着湖面，思索如何杀死艾玛。<br>就在这时——|#0202Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 茂みのガサガサ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_55 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0202Adv09_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:附近的树丛沙沙作响，我立马警惕地绷紧身子。|#0202Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,20 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:下一秒，<br>从树丛里探出身子的是——奈叶香。|#0202Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:又是你啊。<br>难道说你的爱好就是从树丛里冒出来？|#0202Adv09_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我可没有那种癖好。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，你是又想触碰我了吗？|#0202Adv09_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的魔法是【幻视】。<br>据说碰到谁就能看见对方过去的画面。|#0202Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香缓缓摇头。|#0202Adv09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是碰巧遇见你罢了。<br>我刚才在找东西，然后……|#0202Adv09_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哦，我记得你说过<br>自己的发带不见了。找到了吗？|#0202Adv09_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她上来就说是亚里沙偷的，<br>结果两人差点打起来。|#0202Adv09_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香沮丧地摇了摇头。|#0202Adv09_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……没有。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这发带有那么重要吗？<br>被关进来以后，我们自己的所有东西<br>应该全都被拿走了吧。|#0202Adv09_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:话刚落音，<br>我忽然想起自己口袋里的钢笔。|#0202Adv09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:"（难道奈叶香<br>　也和我一样，带着【某种物件】……？）|#0202Adv09_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发带是我在监牢里找回来的。<br>……因为我知道它掉在什么地方。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来如此。和你手上那把枪的来路一样，<br>这也是你靠幻视得来的信息找到的吧。|#0202Adv09_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyCamera Offset:-4,-2 Zoom:0.4 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:她点了点头，<br>于是我开始翻找近处的树丛。|#0202Adv09_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 茂みのガサガサ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_55 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:你，这是在……？|#0202Adv09_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你不是在找东西吗？<br>那我得帮你找到。|#0202Adv09_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 茂みのガサガサ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_55 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:2

[PrintTextModified Text:……你不问原因吗？|#0202Adv09_Nanoka007| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你不想说的话，我也不会多过问。<br>毕竟我也有不愿提起的过去。|#0202Adv09_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……哦。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

