@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:我们在周围<br>四处找了一会……|#0202Adv09_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但最后还是没找到发带。|#0202Adv09_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:我本来想着，<br>可能在调查这附近的时候落在这里了……|#0202Adv09_Nanoka009| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我也不知道究竟是在哪里弄丢的，<br>算了。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka010| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:……是吗。<br>那以后我会多留意<br>监牢里有没有类似东西的。|#0202Adv09_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……谢谢。<br>二阶堂希罗，其实你人挺好的。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka011| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么叫做“其实”啊。<br>我不是一向都行得正坐得直吗？|#0202Adv09_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我并不是在开玩笑，<br>但奈叶香却轻轻地笑了。|#0202Adv09_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:看你总是一脸冷峻地想事情，<br>总感觉你是不是有些不好的企图。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka012| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:（这倒是没说错……）|#0202Adv09_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自从来到这里，我的烦恼越来越多。<br>每天都烦躁得不行。哪怕能摄取点糖分也好。|#0202Adv09_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:糖分……嗯。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka013| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我啊，其实很喜欢做点心。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka014| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她这冷不丁的回答，让我不知该作何反应。|#0202Adv09_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Smile1,ArmL9

[PrintTextModified Text:不介意的话，下次我做给你吃吧。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka015| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这做不到吧。<br>连食材都没有，要怎么做？|#0202Adv09_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:食材的话，我能筹措得到。<br>我知道不少秘密通路，就交给我吧。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka016| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香微微一笑。<br>看来她还挺信任我的。|#0202Adv09_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（明明我想要疏远大家，<br>　可是事不如意啊……）|#0202Adv09_Hiro016|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:秘密通路吗……<br>比起点心，我倒是更关心这个。|#0202Adv09_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Smile1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:那可不是什么值得期待的地方。<br>而且多半，去那里还会违反规定……啊。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka017| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香突然停住话头，盯着我的头顶看。|#0202Adv09_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么了？|#0202Adv09_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的头顶。<br>有片叶子沾在头发上了。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka018| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗，因为刚才在树丛里到处找东西吧。|#0202Adv09_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:55 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL4
@Wait WaitMode:1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:她正准备伸手，<br>却突然像转变心意似的停了下来。|#0202Adv09_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:……不继续吗？<br>刚才可是触碰我的好时机。|#0202Adv09_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（虽然我并不打算让她有机会触碰我）|#0202Adv09_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在的我，一直在考虑如何杀害艾玛，<br>那就决不能让她【幻视】到。|#0202Adv09_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我自己捏住叶子，用手指轻轻弹开了。|#0202Adv09_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:……我改主意了。<br>不会再幻视你。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka019| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:二阶堂希罗。<br>如果是你，也许……|#0202Adv09_Nanoka020| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香欲言又止。|#0202Adv09_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，最终她还是把话吞了下去，没有再往下说。|#0202Adv09_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我该走了。<br>典狱长马上就要来了。|#0202Adv09_Nanoka021| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 茂みのガサガサ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_55 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:话音刚落，<br>她就消失在了树丛深处。|#0202Adv09_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着——|#0202Adv09_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:正如奈叶香所言，典狱长确实来了。|#0202Adv09_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是你啊，希罗小姐。<br>你有在这附近看到奈叶香小姐吗？|#0202Adv09_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不，我没看见。|#0202Adv09_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊。哎呀呀，这可头疼了。<br>奈叶香小姐违反了规定，<br>已逃出监牢好几天了。|#0202Adv09_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一直找不到她……好不容易追过去，<br>她又一眨眼就消失了。|#0202Adv09_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果你看到她，可以告诉我一声吗？|#0202Adv09_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你尽管找就是。<br>这事和我无关吧。|#0202Adv09_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Warden Category:Profile Version:2
[PrintTextModified Text:没有必要告诉典狱长。<br>我丢下这句话就离开了。|#0202Adv09_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

